      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Bonny et al.",
        "AbstractText": "Human coronavirus strain 229E (HCoV-229E) and human alphaherpesvirus 1 were isolated from the plasma of a Haitian child in 2016 with suspected arbovirus diseases. To our knowledge, this is the first description of HCoV-229E in human plasma, which is the focus of this article."
